6:["$","section","EXAMS YOU REQUIRE TO STUDY MBA :-",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"EXAMS YOU REQUIRE TO STUDY MBA :-"}],[["$","p","You will be required to clear either GRE or GMAT with a good score to study MBA in any international university. While GRE and GMAT can be attempted to a max of 5 times in one year . GRE and GMAT tests a student’s ability in verbal,quantitative,integrated reasoning and analytical writing.",{"children":"You will be required to clear either GRE or GMAT with a good score to study MBA in any international university. While GRE and GMAT can be attempted to a max of 5 times in one year . GRE and GMAT tests a student’s ability in verbal,quantitative,integrated reasoning and analytical writing."}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
7:["$","section","Check this :- (our gre gmat blog) for better understaning",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"Check this :- (our gre gmat blog) for better understaning"}],[["$","p","An IELTS score of 6.0 to 6.5, is required to prove your English proficiency in the English language, and it is mandatory in all study destinations abroad.",{"children":"An IELTS score of 6.0 to 6.5, is required to prove your English proficiency in the English language, and it is mandatory in all study destinations abroad."}],["$","p","Also read :- (our ielts and toefl blog )",{"children":"Also read :- (our ielts and toefl blog )"}]],["$","ul",null,{"children":[]}]]}]
8:["$","section","TOP MBA COLLEGES ABROAD",{"children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"TOP MBA COLLEGES ABROAD"}],[["$","p","USA leads the world in many top B-school. An American MBA degree dominates most of the rankings in the world. But , there are many different MBA b-school in other countries with top rankings and with different formats and costs.",{"children":"USA leads the world in many top B-school. An American MBA degree dominates most of the rankings in the world. But , there are many different MBA b-school in other countries with top rankings and with different formats and costs."}],["$","p","Keep in mind that MBA rankings fluctuate every year. Here listed are some top MBA program that consistently get top featured by prominent MBA rankings.",{"children":"Keep in mind that MBA rankings fluctuate every year. Here listed are some top MBA program that consistently get top featured by prominent MBA rankings."}],["$","p","UNITED STATES:-",{"children":"UNITED STATES:-"}],["$","p","It is a birth place of MBA degree . A US MBA degree have a duration of 2 years. They tend to accept young candidates as compared to other countries. To pursue MBA from US you would be required to have minimum of 3-5 years of experience in the field.",{"children":"It is a birth place of MBA degree . A US MBA degree have a duration of 2 years. They tend to accept young candidates as compared to other countries. To pursue MBA from US you would be required to have minimum of 3-5 years of experience in the field."}],["$","p","Cost of MBA degree in US:- $10,000-$35,000 (approx.)",{"children":"Cost of MBA degree in US:- $10,000-$35,000 (approx.)"}],["$","p","TOP COLLEGES:-",{"children":"TOP COLLEGES:-"}],["$","p","EUROPE:-",{"children":"EUROPE:-"}],["$","p","In Europe the MBA degree is 1 year. This one year MBA degree program is more intense and suited for experience professionals with slight higher work experience average of atleast 6-8 years of experience. The advantage of 1 year MBA program is that it would include low cost which includes- tuition fees,living expenses etc. Europe is a good choice for MBA if you want it budget friendly and less time consuming compared to other countries.",{"children":"In Europe the MBA degree is 1 year. This one year MBA degree program is more intense and suited for experience professionals with slight higher work experience average of atleast 6-8 years of experience. The advantage of 1 year MBA program is that it would include low cost which includes- tuition fees,living expenses etc. Europe is a good choice for MBA if you want it budget friendly and less time consuming compared to other countries."}],["$","p","Cost of MBA Degree in Europe :- EUR 35,800 (approx)",{"children":"Cost of MBA Degree in Europe :- EUR 35,800 (approx)"}],["$","p","TOP COLLEGES:-",{"children":"TOP COLLEGES:-"}],["$","p","UNITED KINGDOM",{"children":"UNITED KINGDOM"}],["$","p","The united kingdom has some of the oldest universities. UK is bit expensive but no doubt when it comes to quality of education or packages. The multiculture society and London being the economic and financial centres of the world, make UK attractive and quite the option for MBA. In most universities it is necessary to have three years of full-time managerial work experience.",{"children":"The united kingdom has some of the oldest universities. UK is bit expensive but no doubt when it comes to quality of education or packages. The multiculture society and London being the economic and financial centres of the world, make UK attractive and quite the option for MBA. In most universities it is necessary to have three years of full-time managerial work experience."}],"$L1a","$L1b","$L1c","$L1d","$L1e","$L1f","$L20","$L21","$L22","$L23"],"$L24"]}]
