21:["$","p","Australia started gaining ground as most desirable MBA destinations. They are pretty arranging for scholarships for international students. An MBA degree from Australia can provide exposure to rich,multi-culture experience. Along with opportunity to train in competitive world class environment. The cost of MBA Programs In Australia is low compared to other leading programs in different countries but the living costs are quite high.",{"children":"Australia started gaining ground as most desirable MBA destinations. They are pretty arranging for scholarships for international students. An MBA degree from Australia can provide exposure to rich,multi-culture experience. Along with opportunity to train in competitive world class environment. The cost of MBA Programs In Australia is low compared to other leading programs in different countries but the living costs are quite high."}]
